/**
\mainpage GenProc DEVS model documentation

Generator feeding a single-server job processor, written against PythonPDEVS.
`GenProc` couples a periodic `Generator` to a `JobProcessor` and re-exports the
processor's `out` port; an external `stop` input silences the generator.

| | |
|---|---|
| Root model | \ref devs_genproc |
| Language / framework | Python / PythonPDEVS (pypdevs) |
| Source | `gen_proc.py` |
| Generated | 2026-10-13 by the devs-doxygen skill |

